cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  The glioblastoma immune microenvironment: an interactive map of
  immunosuppression
message: >-
  If you use or adapt this figure, please cite it together with the review it
  represents (listed under references).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Annagiri
    given-names: Shreyas
    affiliation: >-
      Lim Lab, Department of Neurosurgery, Stanford University
abstract: >-
  An interactive visualisation of the mechanisms of immunosuppression and
  immunotherapy resistance in glioblastoma: ten cell types of the tumour niche
  and 26 mechanisms across seven layers (immune checkpoints, antigen
  presentation, cytokines and chemokines, myeloid reprogramming, metabolic
  suppression, hypoxia and vasculature, and T-cell dysfunction and
  sequestration). All content derives from Jackson, Choi and Lim, Nature
  Immunology 2019; the figure reports no new data.
keywords:
  - glioblastoma
  - immunotherapy resistance
  - tumour microenvironment
  - immunosuppression
  - neuro-oncology
  - data visualisation
url: 'https://shreyasannagiri.github.io/gbm-immune-map/'
